    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HARDEST GAME OF 2025? PROVE ME WRONG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re patient? Think you\u2019re skilled? <strong>This game will break you.</strong> One misstep, and you\u2019re tumbling back down. <strong>Again. And again. And again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>THE DARUMA CHALLENGE</strong>, you don\u2019t jump\u2014you <strong>bounce.</strong> Every surface is both an opportunity and a trap. <strong>Master the momentum or lose everything.</strong> A <strong>precision platformer</strong> designed to <strong>punish hesitation, crush overconfidence, and reward only the most determined.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/47a3e18f199c78f1493d438f184ea711.poster.avif?t=1747662654\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/47a3e18f199c78f1493d438f184ea711.webm?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/47a3e18f199c78f1493d438f184ea711.mp4?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU REACH THE TOP?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, physics-based bouncing movement</strong> \u2013 easy to learn, painful to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO shortcuts. NO hand-holding. NO easy mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints? A well-deserved relief\u2026 but only in Normal Mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack Mode? No checkpoints. No mercy. A nightmare for speedrunners.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; hidden paths? Only for those clever (or stubborn) enough to find them.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/a90e66e2ff3517a06b90936a96a9670e.poster.avif?t=1747662654\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/a90e66e2ff3517a06b90936a96a9670e.webm?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/a90e66e2ff3517a06b90936a96a9670e.mp4?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>99% WILL FAIL. WILL YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Daruma doll\u2019s mantra\u2014<strong>\u201cFall down seven times, stand up eight.\u201d</strong>\u2014this game was built for those who <strong>refuse to quit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players won\u2019t make it to the end. <strong>Some won\u2019t even survive the first few jumps.</strong> But a few? They\u2019ll <strong>embrace the suffering, push through the pain, and conquer the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you rage easily, turn back now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was <strong>crafted by a solo developer with care, but not kindness.</strong> Every challenge, every detail\u2014<strong>designed to push you to the limit.</strong> The Daruma always gets back up. <strong>Will you?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HARDEST GAME OF 2025? PROVE ME WRONG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re patient? Think you\u2019re skilled? <strong>This game will break you.</strong> One misstep, and you\u2019re tumbling back down. <strong>Again. And again. And again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>THE DARUMA CHALLENGE</strong>, you don\u2019t jump\u2014you <strong>bounce.</strong> Every surface is both an opportunity and a trap. <strong>Master the momentum or lose everything.</strong> A <strong>precision platformer</strong> designed to <strong>punish hesitation, crush overconfidence, and reward only the most determined.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/47a3e18f199c78f1493d438f184ea711.poster.avif?t=1747662654\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/47a3e18f199c78f1493d438f184ea711.webm?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/47a3e18f199c78f1493d438f184ea711.mp4?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU REACH THE TOP?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, physics-based bouncing movement</strong> \u2013 easy to learn, painful to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO shortcuts. NO hand-holding. NO easy mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints? A well-deserved relief\u2026 but only in Normal Mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack Mode? No checkpoints. No mercy. A nightmare for speedrunners.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; hidden paths? Only for those clever (or stubborn) enough to find them.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/a90e66e2ff3517a06b90936a96a9670e.poster.avif?t=1747662654\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/a90e66e2ff3517a06b90936a96a9670e.webm?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/a90e66e2ff3517a06b90936a96a9670e.mp4?t=1747662654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>99% WILL FAIL. WILL YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Daruma doll\u2019s mantra\u2014<strong>\u201cFall down seven times, stand up eight.\u201d</strong>\u2014this game was built for those who <strong>refuse to quit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players won\u2019t make it to the end. <strong>Some won\u2019t even survive the first few jumps.</strong> But a few? They\u2019ll <strong>embrace the suffering, push through the pain, and conquer the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you rage easily, turn back now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was <strong>crafted by a solo developer with care, but not kindness.</strong> Every challenge, every detail\u2014<strong>designed to push you to the limit.</strong> The Daruma always gets back up. <strong>Will you?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A brutal bouncing challenge. No shortcuts, no mercy\u2014just you vs. gravity. How far will you climb before it all comes crashing down?",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe Daruma Challenge is a pretty cool game, it has some difficult sections, but it's a fun platformer Foddian game. I enjoyed searching for the hidden Easter Eggs and Sanctuaries across the map. The Sanctuaries provided mini difficult puzzles alongside the main path for experienced players to attempt, which was nice. I like how there is a Time Attack mode which removes the checkpoints, it allows for an even harder challenge in the game. Overall, The Daruma Challenge is a perfect game for players that enjoy the Foddian Genre of games.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Mindblower21000<br><br>\u201c\u548c\u98a8\u3060\u308b\u307e\u767b\u5c71\u3000\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u3007 \u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u30dd\u30a4\u30f3\u30c8\u304c\u3042\u308a\u4e0a\u308a\u3084\u3059\u3044\u6c17\u3082\u3059\u308b\u304c \u6b62\u307e\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306e\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Game Reviewers(JP)<br><br>\u201c\u3010Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy\u3011\u66fe\u6709\u53e5\u540d\u8a00\uff1a\u6211\u505a\u7684\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f\uff0c \u662f\u4e3a\u4e86\u67d0\u79cd\u7279\u5b9a\u7c7b\u578b\u7684\u4eba \u4e3a\u4e86\u4f24\u5bb3\u4ed6\u4eec\u3002\u672c\u4f5c\u3010\u8fbe\u9c81\u9a6c\u6311\u6218\u3011\u63a8\u8350\u7ed9\u66fe\u7ecf\u62e5\u6709\u540c\u6837\u5c5e\u6027\u7684\u4f60~\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 \u7f6a\u6076\u88c5\u5907Xrd-SIGN-\uff08GGXrdS\uff09\u7f51\u6218\u4ea4\u6d41\u7ec4<br>",
